    {
     "header": "vygi0400",
     "text": "Just as I have allies, I also have trusted servants in my deck who have fought alongside me!"
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0401",
     "text": "In this match, the one who believes in his own deck will win."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0402",
     "text": "The key to victory in this battle is the power of our unity!"
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0403",
     "text": "Are you my opponent?. This looks like it's going to be a fierce battle."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0404",
     "text": "I get it. It'll take on this duel. And I'll defeat you!"
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0405",
     "text": "As a true Duelist, it's time for a serious fight with pride on the line. Prepare yourself."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0406",
     "text": "I won't go easy on you. I'm going all out!"
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0407",
     "text": "Hmph. I'll praise you for not running away from me."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0408",
     "text": "My own memories. My vows with my friends. To get that light, I will win!"
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0410",
     "text": "Come forth! Dark Magician!"
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0411",
     "text": "Come forth! Dark Magician Girl!"
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0420",
     "text": "A splendid victory."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0421",
     "text": "In the future beyond this defeat, there is sure to be an answer."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0422",
     "text": "You will definitely come back. I believe in that future."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0423",
     "text": "I acknowledge your abilities. There is a line between us now, but there is no difference in strength."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0424",
     "text": "Pride, Soul, and Strength were all on the line. It was the best duel ever!"
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0425",
     "text": "Sorry, but now that I'm in the ring, I can't lose."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0426",
     "text": "As expected, I'm looking forward to the next one!"
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0427",
     "text": "To all the cards that gave me strength, as well as my friends; Thank you."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0770",
     "text": "This duel, it seems like our unity made it happen"
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0771",
     "text": "Without you, I wouldn't have been able to achieve this victory. I'm counting on you."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0772",
     "text": "Come challenge us again."
    },
    {
     "header": "vygi0773",
     "text": "My friend, his name is Joey. I think you'd get along well."
    }
   ]
  },
