    {
     "header": "CMDCEN07T",
     "text": "^mBtnX;: This functions like a traditional ^mBtnS; and is freely cancellable. ^mBtnY; or ^mBtnB;: You can perform a Super Dash during the attack."
    },
    {
     "header": "CMDCEN08",
     "text": "^aCMDGauge06;^aSpecial;Oh, this suits me well!"
