    {
     "header": "CMDCEN11T",
     "text": "[THE WORLD] thrusts forward with a powerful punch that reflects ki-blast. Can perform another follow-up attack with ^mAtk214;^mBtnX; or ^mBtnY; or ^mBtnB;"
