     "header": "vdio0401",
     "text": "Hahahahahaha... I'll give you one chance."
    },
    {
     "header": "vdio0402",
     "text": "What's wrong? You're trembling."
    },
    {
     "header": "vdio0403",
     "text": "Relax. You don't have to be scared sick."
    },
    {
     "header": "vdio0404",
     "text": "Oh? You're approaching me? Instead of running away, you are coming right to me?"
    },
    {
     "header": "vdio0405",
     "text": "You seem to have a special ability that is not normal for humans. I would be happy if you could show that to me."
    },
    {
     "header": "vdio0406",
     "text": "Are you using Hamon? It probably won't help you get through the [THE WORLD]. Come!"
    },
    {
     "header": "vdio0407",
     "text": "What do you think of it? You're not going to be friends with me?"
